---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Supplier Risk Intelligence Platform">
  <section class="hero shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">AI / ML / RAG ENGINEERING DEMO</p>
    <h1>Explain supplier risk before disruption becomes visible.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      A portfolio reference implementation connecting a TypeScript API to a Python risk engine,
      with versioned contracts and observable request boundaries.
    </p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button primary" href="/demo">Run the M1 demo</a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="/architecture">View architecture</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="shell grid three" aria-label="System capabilities">
    <article class="card">
      <span class="step">01</span>
      <h2>Quantitative risk</h2>
      <p>XGBoost inference and risk-driver explanations arrive in milestone M2.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <span class="step">02</span>
      <h2>Evidence retrieval</h2>
      <p>Hybrid retrieval, temporal decay and citations arrive in milestone M3.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <span class="step">03</span>
      <h2>Observable API</h2>
      <p>M1 already connects the browser, Fastify and FastAPI with correlation metadata.</p>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
